sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Người dùng (Customer / Vendor)
    participant Ctrl as NotificationController<br/>(/api/notifications)
    participant ReadUC as MarkNotificationReadUseCase
    participant ReadAllUC as MarkAllNotificationsReadUseCase
    participant UnreadUC as GetUnreadNotificationCountUseCase
    participant ListUC as GetNotificationsUseCase
    participant Repo as JpaNotificationRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over User, DB: Luồng Trung Tâm Thông Báo & Theo Dõi Trạng Thái Đã Đọc (R4)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User, DB: 1. Xem danh sách thông báo cá nhân
        User->>Ctrl: GET /api/notifications?page=0&size=20 (JWT required)
        activate Ctrl
        Ctrl->>ListUC: execute(userId, page, size)
        activate ListUC
        ListUC->>Repo: findByUserIdOrderByCreatedAtDesc(userId, Pageable)
        Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM notifications WHERE user_id = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC
        DB-->>Repo: Page<NotificationJpaEntity>
        ListUC-->>Ctrl: Page<NotificationResponse> (gồm isRead, readAt, channel, referenceId)
        deactivate ListUC
        Ctrl-->>User: 200 OK (PageResponse)
        deactivate Ctrl
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over User, DB: 2. Đánh dấu đã đọc một thông báo cụ thể (Chống IDOR)
        User->>Ctrl: PATCH /api/notifications/{id}/read
        activate Ctrl
        Ctrl->>ReadUC: execute(notificationId, userId)
        activate ReadUC
        ReadUC->>Repo: findById(notificationId)
        Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM notifications WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>Repo: NotificationJpaEntity

        alt Thông báo không tồn tại
            ReadUC-->>Ctrl: NotificationNotFoundException
            Ctrl-->>User: 404 Not Found
        else Vi phạm quyền sở hữu (IDOR - thông báo của user khác)
            ReadUC-->>Ctrl: UnauthorizedNotificationAccessException
            Ctrl-->>User: 403 Forbidden
        end

        opt Thông báo chưa đọc (!isRead)
            ReadUC->>ReadUC: notification.markAsRead(now)
            ReadUC->>Repo: save(notification)
            Repo->>DB: UPDATE notifications SET is_read = true, read_at = now WHERE id = ?
        end

        ReadUC-->>Ctrl: NotificationResponse (isRead = true, readAt = timestamp)
        deactivate ReadUC
        Ctrl-->>User: 200 OK (NotificationResponse)
        deactivate Ctrl
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over User, DB: 3. Đánh dấu đã đọc toàn bộ thông báo (Bulk Update Idempotent)
        User->>Ctrl: PATCH /api/notifications/read-all
        activate Ctrl
        Ctrl->>ReadAllUC: execute(userId)
        activate ReadAllUC
        ReadAllUC->>Repo: markAllAsReadByUserId(userId, now)
        Repo->>DB: UPDATE notifications SET is_read = true, read_at = now WHERE user_id = ? AND is_read = false
        DB-->>Repo: int updatedRowsCount
        ReadAllUC-->>Ctrl: updatedRowsCount
        deactivate ReadAllUC
        Ctrl-->>User: 200 OK (MarkAllNotificationsReadResponse: {updatedCount})
        deactivate Ctrl
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
        Note over User, DB: 4. Lấy số lượng thông báo chưa đọc (Badge Counter)
        User->>Ctrl: GET /api/notifications/unread-count
        activate Ctrl
        Ctrl->>UnreadUC: execute(userId)
        activate UnreadUC
        UnreadUC->>Repo: countByUserIdAndIsReadFalse(userId)
        Repo->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM notifications WHERE user_id = ? AND is_read = false
        DB-->>Repo: long unreadCount
        UnreadUC-->>Ctrl: unreadCount
        deactivate UnreadUC
        Ctrl-->>User: 200 OK (UnreadCountResponse: {unreadCount})
        deactivate Ctrl
    end
